<p>Crude		47,000 (ULD)     G.S.Salaria	    12/01</p>
<p>Crude		27,000 (ULD)     Homi Baba		12/01</p>
<p>Raw Cashew	  5,500 (ULD)     Shanghai		 12/01</p>
<p>Motor Spirit     10,000 (LDD)     Vishwadoot	     14/01</p>
